  "translation": "Na boda i go daunbilo long end bilong maunten we i stap fronthed bilong gorges bilong pikinini bilong Hinom, we i stap long vale bilong Refaim, long not; na i go daunbilo long gorges bilong Hinom i go long sayd bilong Jebusi, long saut, na i go daunbilo long Ein-Rogel.",
